        "wire-2026-10-23-1543-arc-2-renxiaohan-surges-to-twenty-ninth"
      ],
      "text": "Lee Minseung closes 26th at 59.58, up eleven places and 9.16 points in the available previous-close comparison. That brings Lee closer to the public gold threshold of 66.53, though still below it. The afternoon wire also recorded renxiaohan jumping from 840th to 29th at 56.94 after a 26.11-point score increase. That rank belongs to the wire’s afternoon observation, not a verified evening position. Together, the moves show the chase advancing below a gold line that remains well above both reported scores."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Chen and Tufa hold; nvbanana stands third",
      "sourceIds": [
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0",
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Yi-Chia Chen remains second at 84.72 behind Tufa Labs at 88.06, both unchanged against the previous close. nvbanana closes third at 81.39, ahead of rabbithole at 80.83. A saved event records nvbanana rising from 79.72 and fourth place to third; its previous-close comparison is unavailable, so that event is not a verified daily total. ALbert RUehlman closes sixth at 75.56 after a separate recorded increase from 72.64. The order near the top can change even while the first two stand still."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The climb continues through the field",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "kibuna closes 30th at 57.22, up two places and 2.50 points against the available baseline. Daewoo Myoung rises nine places to 44th at 47.92, and Junhua Yang gains thirteen places to 58th at 42.50. ARC Raiders holds 13th at 68.75, above the closing gold threshold. ARC Mutants stays at 39.31 but slips five places to 67th: an unchanged score does not guarantee an unchanged place."
    },
    {
