        "wire-2026-10-23-1543-arc-2-kaggle-arc-climbs-into-top-hundred"
      ],
      "text": "Earlier wire reports recorded Rick at 51st with 43.75 and Yuvraj #2 at 43rd with 47.08. The midday wire placed Omar Althobaiti 94th at 35.00 and observed Thanh Hau Nguyen at 34th with 54.72. The latter is a new observation in that history window, not proof of a first-ever entry. The afternoon wire recorded KaggleARC climbing from 135th to 98th at 34.86. These are dated reports from different windows, not a second set of evening standings. The depth of movement is the story; each earlier rank must stay attached to its observation."
